# ── Basemap assets ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# mobileAssets/ at the repo root IS committed (decision 31 Aug 2026): a clone
# must work with no downloads. Those files are NOT AGPL — Ground Truth Data's
# own imagery, see mobileAssets/LICENSE.md. In the fetch workspace,
# ReTreever/static/mobileAssets remains the source of truth; fetchAssets.sh
# prefers it and falls back to the committed copy only outside the workspace.
# static/mobileAssets/ stays ignored — it's fetchAssets.sh's COPY DESTINATION,
# and gitEr/shipAll.sh + publishChildren.sh stage with `git add -A`.
static/mobileAssets/

# ── Environment variables & secrets ─────────────────────────────────────────
# This repo is PUBLIC and is also packed into the npm tarball, and npm-packlist
# honours this file. Mirrors ReTreever/.gitignore:89-106.
.env
.env.*
.env.local
!.env.example
credentials*.json
*.pem
*.key
secrets/
.secrets/
# Cloudflare Workers local secrets + state.
.dev.vars
.wrangler/

# ── World hospitals bake (workers/bakeHospitals.mjs) ─────────────────────────
# The baked pack itself (workers/*/src/hospitalsWorld.v*.bin) IS committed —
# it ships inside the Worker bundle. Only the resumable Overpass download
# scratch (~100 MB) stays out.
workers/.bake-cache/
